@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 查看状态
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/knowledge/status

### 按用户与标签检索
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/knowledge/search
Content-Type: application/json

{"ownerId":"alice","query":"工具调用由谁管理？","tag":"spring-ai","topK":3}

### RAG 问答并返回来源
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/knowledge/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{"ownerId":"alice","question":"工具调用由谁管理？","tag":"spring-ai","topK":3}

### 创建笔记
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/knowledge/notes
Content-Type: application/json

{"ownerId":"alice","title":"回归清单","content":"发布前运行完整测试。","tag":"work"}

### 全量重建可派生向量索引
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/knowledge/reindex
